# pipeline.py audit

- [ ] Does every graph edge point from an earlier occurrence to a later occurrence?
- [ ] Is a revisit represented by a new occurrence plus canonical-state identity, never a cycle?
- [ ] Does TRUE_MERGE require at least two evidence-bearing semantic parents?
- [ ] Are branch tokens propagated without using MERGE/REUSE edges to fabricate branch identity?
- [ ] Do state and transition FCA contexts remain separate from the graph truth layer?
- [ ] Is relational scaling explicitly labelled as RCA-style, not full Multi-FCA?
- [ ] Does every trace cite exact event IDs, edge IDs, and a frozen rule ID?
- [ ] Do flattened/tree baselines consume the exact same DAG without model calls?
- [ ] Does the incremental reference replay equal the batch scientific fingerprint?

